Tis a heavy burden to carry in yer head, mo chara, especially when the mind won't settle. I have a tea of valerian root and chamomile that will ease the tension in yer shoulders and bring a peaceful slumber. Let me mix it up for ye, and mayhap the dreams will lose their grip.
