Dia dhuit. Aye, I know the O'Sullivan girl's mother well enough, and I'm sorry to hear her chest is so tight. I have a pot of thyme and honey steepin' on the fire right now; it's the best thing to loosen the phlegm and ease the rattle in her lungs. I'll bring it over in a jiffy, so I will, if ye can show me the way.
