Ye'd best fetch me when the pains come regular, every ten minutes or so, and don't wait till the water breaks if ye can help it. I know yer wife's constitution well enough, so I'll know if the babe is in a hurry to meet the world. Come to me then, and I'll have the fire lit and the linen ready.
