The Father has his cross to bear, but I have my patients to keep alive, so I mind my own business. Aye, he may call it the work of the sídhe, but I know well enough when a fever takes hold or a babe is in distress. Ye'd best ask the right person hereabouts if ye want to know about souls, but if a woman's in labour, I'm the one they call.

